Greetings!  This is a collection of YANIs by users of the #nethack IRC
channel on freenode.net.  Hopefully it will prove to be the first of
many.  YANIs are often posted to #nethack, but many, if not most, were
never recorded nor seen by the RGRN community.  Please excuse any old
ideas that may be present.

Rodney ideas[2]: Placing a lit candle|lamp inside a greased bag should
incinerate the bag, any flamable contents, and it should damage you and
abuse wisdom.

Rodney ideas[3]: Tallow candles should be edible and fairly nutritious.

Rodney ideas[4]: If you are turned to stone, there should be a small
but finite chance that (after the passage of many years) you will be
stone-to-fleshed by an adventurer (eg. a human Valkyrie).  That
adventurer will probably be hostile or might demand payment of some
kind or there may be a slim chance that it is peaceful.

Rodney ideas[5]: Lit candles should go out when you stand next to a
hidden door, trapdoor or hole. "A sudden draft extinguishes your
candle."

Rodney ideas[6]:  Quaffing fruit juice should reduce hallucination
timeout - as per urban legend (see
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drug_urban_legends).

Rodney ideas[7]: The traditional Catalan/Andorran hat called the
Barretina was worn by smugglers.  It is sack-like in shape and made it
easy to carry concealed items.  It would be neat if one could put items
in such a hat and have a chance that a shopkeeper wouldn't notice you'd
stolen anything as you walked out the door.

Rodney ideas[8]: Vlad is known to be weak. Giving Vlad an automatic
cursed scroll of teleport would encourage using creative solutions to
defeat him, because otherwise you would have to track him through the
entire dungeon. Potential options include fire and nymphs (or just
careful use of a stethoscope).

Rodney ideas[9]: If you throw/kick/drop_while_levitating a container
that contains a !oPoly and that potion breaks, then the container
should polymorph or some/all of the contents should.

Rodney ideas[10]: Candy bars should confer blindness to pet types.
(chocolate is poisonous to dogs, so deal damage to them? - ed.)

Rodney ideas[11]: Chastity belts!

Rodney ideas[12]: Swimming while satiated can cause you to drown from
stomach cramps, as per Urban Legend.

Rodney ideas[13]: Having reflection should act as conflict to, and
teleport nearby waterlife to you, if you fall in water.

Rodney ideas[14]: the moon phases should affect the plane of water

Rodney ideas[15]: EARPLUGS!! (Like the blindfold. They help resist
sound-based attacks, like hissings.)

Rodney ideas[16]: YANI: Artifact: Rincewind's Boots.  Make you very
very fast ... but only when running away. (Discworld)

